  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your shield protects yourself and your mount.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mounted Combat, Mounted Shield, Shield Focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If you are mounted and using a shield, your mount gains the full benefits of the shield (including any magic abilities it has, but not any attacks the shield can make).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc234\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
